{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f4a7c9e1-3b6d-4e2a-8c5f-9a1d7b3e6c42",
    "name": "TC3 - Scheduling Service (REST + JWT) - Completa",
    "description": "Testa todas as operacoes REST do scheduling-service e as regras de autorizacao/negocio por role.\n\nComo usar:\n1. Suba os servicos: `docker compose up --build auth-service scheduling-service`.\n2. Rode a pasta '0 - Tokens JWT' inteira uma vez. Ela grava doctorToken / nurseToken / patientToken.\n3. Rode as demais pastas em ordem (0 -> 8). Cada pasta depende de estado criado pelas anteriores (ids de consulta salvos em variaveis da collection).\n\nEndpoints: {{baseUrl}}/appointments | {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{id} | {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{id}/status | {{baseUrl}}/appointments/me | {{baseUrl}}/availability\n\nRegras exercitadas:\n- create: DOCTOR ou NURSE\n- update (PUT, reagendar): somente DOCTOR; so altera dateTime/notes, patientId/doctorId sao ignorados\n- updateStatus (PATCH /status): DOCTOR ou NURSE; nao pode mudar consulta ja CANCELLED/COMPLETED; nao pode voltar para SCHEDULED\n- getAll / getById: DOCTOR ou NURSE\n- /me: somente PATIENT, retorna so as consultas do proprio subject do JWT\n- /availability: DOCTOR, NURSE ou PATIENT\n- patientId deve ser um usuario com role PATIENT; doctorId deve ser um usuario com role DOCTOR\n- antecedencia minima de 3 dias pra marcar consulta\n- conflito: nao pode marcar 2 consultas do mesmo medico com menos de 1h de diferenca (consultas CANCELLED nao contam)\n- disponibilidade deve excluir os horarios dentro dessa mesma janela de 1h, nao so o horario exato",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {"key": "authBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "patientId", "value": "3", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "doctorId", "value": "1", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "doctorToken", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "nurseToken", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "patientToken", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "apt1Id", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "apt2Id", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "apt3Id", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "apt4Id", "value": "", "type": "string"}
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Todas as datas em ISO-8601 sem timezone (formato aceito por LocalDateTime.parse),",
          "// sempre >= 3 dias no futuro pra passar na regra de antecedencia minima.",
          "const pad = n => String(n).padStart(2, '0');",
          "function isoNoZone(d) {",
          "  return `${d.getFullYear()}-${pad(d.getMonth()+1)}-${pad(d.getDate())}T${pad(d.getHours())}:${pad(d.getMinutes())}:${pad(d.getSeconds())}`;",
          "}",
          "function atDaysHour(days, hour, minute) {",
          "  const d = new Date();",
          "  d.setDate(d.getDate() + days);",
          "  d.setHours(hour, minute || 0, 0, 0);",
          "  return d;",
          "}",
          "",
          "const apt1 = atDaysHour(10, 10, 0);   // consulta que sera cancelada",
          "const apt2 = atDaysHour(11, 10, 0);   // consulta que sera concluida (COMPLETED)",
          "const apt3 = atDaysHour(13, 10, 0);   // consulta usada so pra checar disponibilidade",
          "const apt4 = atDaysHour(14, 10, 0);   // consulta usada pra reagendar (PUT)",
          "",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('apt1DateTime', isoNoZone(apt1));",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('apt2DateTime', isoNoZone(apt2));",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('apt3DateTime', isoNoZone(apt3));",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('apt4DateTime', isoNoZone(apt4));",
          "",
          "// 30 min depois do apt1 -> dentro da janela de 1h de conflito",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('conflictDateTime', isoNoZone(new Date(apt1.getTime() + 30*60*1000)));",
          "// 4h depois do apt1, mesmo dia -> fora da janela de conflito, usado nos testes de patientId/doctorId invalidos",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('farDateTime', isoNoZone(atDaysHour(10, 14, 0)));",
          "// so 1 dia no futuro -> viola a antecedencia minima de 3 dias",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('soonDateTime', isoNoZone(atDaysHour(1, 9, 0)));",
          "// novo horario pra reagendar o apt4 (ainda >= 3 dias no futuro)",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('rescheduleDateTime', isoNoZone(atDaysHour(15, 9, 0)));",
          "",
          "// data (sem hora) do apt3, usada na consulta de disponibilidade",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('availabilityDate', `${apt3.getFullYear()}-${pad(apt3.getMonth()+1)}-${pad(apt3.getDate())}`);",
          "// apt3 e' as 10:00 -> janela de conflito e' [09:00, 11:00] inclusive",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('blockedSlot1', '09:00:00');",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('blockedSlot2', '11:00:00');",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('freeSlotNear', '08:00:00');",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('freeSlotFar', '14:00:00');"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
